erence><Reference><Citation>S&#xf8;rensen JG, Loeschcke V (2002) Decreased heat-shock resistance and down-regulation of Hsp70 expression with increasing age in adult Drosophila melanogaster. Functional Ecology 16: 379&#x2013;384.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Li J, Roubeix C, Wang Y, Shi S, Liu G, et al. (2012) Therapeutic efficacy of trehalose eye drops for treatment of murine dry eye induced by an intelligently controlled environmental system. Mol Vis 18: 317&#x2013;329.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC3283206</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">22355243</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Richards AB, Krakowka S, Dexter LB, Schmid H, Wolterbeek AP, et al. (2002) Trehalose: a review of properties, history of use and human tolerance, and results of multiple safety studies. Food Chem Toxicol 40: 871&#x2013;898.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">12065209</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Bregegere F, Milner Y, Friguet B (2006) The ubiquitin-proteasome system at the crossroads of stress-response and ageing pathways: a handle for skin care? Ageing Res Rev 5: 60&#x2013;90.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">16330259</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Gelino S, Hansen M (2012) Autophagy - An Emerging Anti-Aging Mechanism. J Clin Exp Pathol Suppl 4.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC3674854</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">23750326</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Xin H, Xu X, Li L, Ning H, Rong Y, et al. (2005) CHIP controls the sensitivity of transforming growth factor-beta signaling by modulating the basal level of Smad3 through ubiquitin-mediated degradation. J Biol Chem 280: 20842&#x2013;20850.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">15781469</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Bokov A, Chaudhuri A, Richardson A (2004) The role of oxidative